  "label": "Dehumanization Through Pseudoscience",
  "description": "The meme uses pseudo-scientific claims to strip Black people of their humanity, portraying them as 'beasts' or 'animals'. This is a common tactic in racist propaganda to justify oppression and violence. The image of the Black man is used as a visual target for this dehumanizing message.",
